{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-40762b3613", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "我以前很少运动，现在每周游泳两次。", "en": "I used to rarely exercise, but now I swim twice a week.", "sub": "以前很少运动，现在每周游泳两次", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:24:59+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-23ea909bfa", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "以前我几乎不运动，现在每周去游两次泳。", "en": "I used to hardly ever exercise, but now I swim twice a week.", "sub": "以前很少运动，现在每周游泳两次", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:24:59+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-cc24433d20", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "我以前总吃外卖，现在一般自己做饭。", "en": "I used to always order takeout, but now I usually cook myself.", "sub": "以前总吃外卖，现在自己做饭", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:24:59+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-8c15c0771b", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "以前我几乎天天点外卖，现在每天自己做饭。", "en": "I used to order takeout almost every day, but now I cook every day.", "sub": "以前总吃外卖，现在自己做饭", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:24:59+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-af54600e34", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "我以前经常熬夜，现在十一点就睡了。", "en": "I used to stay up late often, but now I go to bed at ten o'clock.", "sub": "以前熬夜，现在十一点睡", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:24:59+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-25c9fe860c", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "以前我总要熬到一两点，现在尽量十一点睡。", "en": "I used to have to stay up until one or two, but now I try to be in bed by ten.", "sub": "以前熬夜，现在十一点睡", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:24:59+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-9cc55c453a", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "我以前每天喝奶茶，现在改喝水了。", "en": "I used to drink milk tea every day, but now I just drink water.", "sub": "以前每天喝奶茶，现在改喝水", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:10+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-59645f3ed2", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "以前我一天一杯奶茶，现在基本只喝水。", "en": "I used to have one cup of milk tea a day, but now I mostly just drink water.", "sub": "以前每天喝奶茶，现在改喝水", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:10+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-7361735710", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "我以前几乎不走路，现在每天走一万步。", "en": "I used to hardly ever walk, but now I take 10,000 steps every day.", "sub": "以前不走路，现在每天走一万步", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:10+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-f9e710e1c8", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "changes", "micro_zh": "最近改变", "zh": "以前我出门就坐车，现在每天走路一万步。", "en": "I used to always take a ride when going out, but now I walk 10,000 steps every day.", "sub": "以前不走路，现在每天走一万步", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:10+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-ca2e02d254", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "我以前不吃早饭，现在每天都吃。", "en": "I used to never eat breakfast, but now I eat it every day.", "sub": "以前不吃早饭，现在每天吃", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:10+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-9da555cbcc", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "以前我早上什么都不吃，现在每天都会吃早饭。", "en": "I used to eat nothing for breakfast in the morning, but now I always eat breakfast every day.", "sub": "以前不吃早饭，现在每天吃", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:10+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-1e4b8b5531", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "我以前很少吃蔬菜，现在每餐都有。", "en": "I used to rarely eat vegetables, but now I have them at every meal.", "sub": "以前很少吃蔬菜，现在每餐都有", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:14+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-52133d1e61", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "我以前从来不体检，现在每年查一次。", "en": "I used to never get checked, but now I check every year.", "sub": "以前不体检，现在每年查一次", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:17+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-64e5a7493f", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "以前我几乎不吃青菜，现在每顿都吃蔬菜。", "en": "I used to hardly eat vegetables, but now I have them at every meal.", "sub": "以前很少吃蔬菜，现在每餐都有", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:21+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-928056ff1a", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "我以前周末都在家躺着，现在会去爬山。", "en": "I used to lie around at home on weekends, but now I go hiking.", "sub": "以前周末躺着，现在去爬山", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:22+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-3e50bdf458", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "以前我周末不出门，现在每周末都去爬山。", "en": "I used to stay indoors on weekends, but now I go hiking every weekend.", "sub": "以前周末躺着，现在去爬山", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:23+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-eb841f41eb", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "我以前总喝咖啡，现在改喝茶了。", "en": "I used to drink coffee all the time, but now I prefer tea.", "sub": "以前总喝咖啡，现在改喝茶", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:25+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-d13bb3eaf2", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "以前我每天喝好几杯咖啡，现在主要喝茶。", "en": "I used to drink several cups of coffee every day, but now I mainly drink tea.", "sub": "以前总喝咖啡，现在改喝茶", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:26+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_health_habits-0792dbeec7", "scene": "narrative_health_habits", "scene_zh": "叙事·健康习惯", "scene_en": "Narrative: Health Habits", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "routine", "micro_zh": "日常习惯", "zh": "以前我觉得体检没必要，现在每年都会去检查。", "en": "I used to think health check-ups weren't necessary, but now I go every year.", "sub": "以前不体检，现在每年查一次", "angle": "used to for the past + now for the present", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_health_habits", "topic": "health_habits", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_health_habits", "topic::health_habits"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:25:27+00:00"}
